Third-party / upstream code
---------------------------
Vendored files:
  * tools/idl-gen/src/main.rs — from logos-blockchain/lez-programs
    (tools/idl-gen/src/main.rs, Copyright (c) 2026 Logos Blockchain, commit 6956b23), MIT.

Otherwise no upstream source is vendored into this repository. Argo depends on
the SPEL framework (logos-co/spel, MIT) and the Logos Execution Zone
(logos-blockchain/logos-execution-zone, MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Vac) as Cargo
dependencies only. logos-blockchain/lez-programs (MIT) is used as the layout
and pattern reference for SPEL programs.
When any upstream file is copied into this tree, list it here with its origin
commit and licence.

Morpho Blue (morpho-org/morpho-blue, GPL-2.0-or-later) is used as the
behavioural and accounting reference only. No Solidity is copied; the
implementation is independent Rust for LEZ.
